        "TileImage": "$($repository cdef527b-e581-49c4-82d5-5b5c0bc7441b).Image",
        "Description": "Good news 47. When you eliminated &quot;Little S&quot; in Bangkok, the chip in hit neck activated and we were able to track it.\r\r\rYou have 3 targets. They are Dan Buckman the &quot;feeder&quot;, Paola Bravo Magana and Paul Powers, he is known in the ring as &quot;Neptune, the drowner&quot;\rThe girls his disfatisfied in, he drowns them. Dan Duckman is known as the &quot;feeder&quot;, girls he disslikes he feeds to his animals, alive!...\r\r\rSo Eliminate the as soon as possible\r\rGood Hunting        - D. Burnwood",
